aedroxh7: mount the /etc ROMFS so the startup scripts run

Without CONFIG_ETC_ROMFS the image has rcS compiled in but NuttX never
mounts it at /etc, so NSH starts and nothing else does: no sensor drivers,
no logger, no MAVLink.

diff --git a/boards/aedrox/aedroxh7/nuttx-config/nsh/defconfig b/boards/aedrox/aedroxh7/nuttx-config/nsh/defconfig
index 647aaea9a3..73eac7651f 100644
--- a/boards/aedrox/aedroxh7/nuttx-config/nsh/defconfig
+++ b/boards/aedrox/aedroxh7/nuttx-config/nsh/defconfig
@@ -245,3 +245,6 @@ CONFIG_USBDEV_BUSPOWERED=y
 CONFIG_USBDEV_MAXPOWER=500
 CONFIG_USEC_PER_TICK=1000
 CONFIG_WATCHDOG=y
+CONFIG_ETC_ROMFS=y
+CONFIG_ETC_CROMFS=y
+CONFIG_ETC_ROMFSSECTSIZE=128
